{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the dunes of the great <strong>Cactuky</strong>, the small town of\u00a0<strong>Thorn-City</strong>  seemingly calm, transforms into a true theater of banditry at nightfall. Your group, commonly known as the CactusBandido, wreaks havoc across the land and engages in a fraternal war to acquire as many Roulstaches as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their method is simple\u2014there is none!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The helpless townspeople, constantly under attack by the bank robbers, have called upon one of the best cactus trackers in the entire country:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cLarry Preston\u201d</strong> a sheriff completely obsessed with the CactusBandidos, has fortified the town\u2019s defenses! He won\u2019t hesitate to open fire if you cross the light of the spotlights in the middle of the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Cactus-Steam_Plan_de_travail_1_copie_4.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Render-avec-fon.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> \u2013 Dive into intense, hand-to-hand battles against the other cacti. There's no room for a KO: only victory and loot matter! Be ready to attack relentlessly and parry every blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Cactus-Steam_Plan_de_travail_1_copie_3.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/BONUS-plusnom.jpg?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonuses</strong> \u2013 Search crates to find powerful bonuses, divided into three categories: offensive, defensive, and passive. These bonuses will help you speed up your progress, defend against other cacti, and attack them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Cactus-Steam_Plan_de_travail_1.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Rendu-Blender-Train+pouletos-trans.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong> \u2013 Throughout the night, events will disrupt your heist. They are divided into two categories: &quot;Temporal,&quot; which occur randomly, and &quot;Sheriff\u2019s Ultimates,&quot; which empower the sheriff when his anger peaks due to the cacti\u2019s indiscretions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Cactus-Steam_Plan_de_travail_1_copie_2.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330290/extras/Montage-Bani\u00e8re-Argent-V8-Trans.png?t=1759332588\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roulstaches</strong> \u2013 The Roulstache is the currency that fuels the <strong>Cactuky</strong>\u00a0state,<strong> </strong>it's<strong>\u00a0</strong>driving the cactus confrontations. Collect them to buy cosmetic items, customize your cactus, and increase your wealth.</p>","backg